### Create user
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testing@est.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Login user
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testing@est.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Verify email (token: 64 hex chars from verification link)
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/verify-email?token=2437282ae53c7af1981eebe4088b13b9bfe1a7e656be07f525f0ade2c9dcce22

### Resend verification email
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/resend-verification
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testing@est.com"
}

### Get me
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me

### Sign out
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signout

### Request password reset
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testing@est.com"
}

### Reset password (token: 64 hex chars from reset link)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "2437282ae53c7af1981eebe4088b13b9bfe1a7e656be07f525f0ade2c9dcce22",
  "password": "newpassword123"
}